2025-08-06 13:20:21,102 - INFO - Subprocess[245]:         Morning Wake-up                                                 
2025-08-06 13:20:21,102 - INFO - Subprocess[246]:            07:00 - 07:45                                               
2025-08-06 13:20:21,102 - INFO - Subprocess[247]:            Why: Starting the day with structured activities sets the   
2025-08-06 13:20:21,102 - INFO - Subprocess[248]:             tone for consistency and improves circadian rhythm,            
2025-08-06 13:20:21,102 - INFO - Subprocess[249]:             supporting both mental alertness and sleep quality.            
2025-08-06 13:20:21,102 - INFO - Subprocess[250]:           1. Open curtains and get natural light exposure for 5          
2025-08-06 13:20:21,103 - INFO - Subprocess[251]:             minutes.                                                       
2025-08-06 13:20:21,103 - INFO - Subprocess[252]:               Exposure to natural light helps regulate the circadian   
2025-08-06 13:20:21,103 - INFO - Subprocess[253]:                 rhythm and signals the body to wake up, easing the         
2025-08-06 13:20:21,103 - INFO - Subprocess[254]:                 transition from sleep while reinforcing a consistent       
2025-08-06 13:20:21,103 - INFO - Subprocess[255]:                 wake-up schedule.                                          
2025-08-06 13:20:21,103 - INFO - Subprocess[256]:           2. Engage in a 5-minute guided breathing or mindfulness        
2025-08-06 13:20:21,103 - INFO - Subprocess[257]:              session.                                                       
2025-08-06 13:20:21,103 - INFO - Subprocess[258]:                This brief mindfulness practice reduces work-related     
2025-08-06 13:20:21,104 - INFO - Subprocess[259]:                  stress and primes the mind for a focused day, especially   
2025-08-06 13:20:21,104 - INFO - Subprocess[260]:                  useful for novices starting to build a reliable routine.   
2025-08-06 13:20:21,104 - INFO - Subprocess[261]:         Focus Block                                                     
2025-08-06 13:20:21,104 - INFO - Subprocess[262]:            08:00 - 09:30                                               
2025-08-06 13:20:21,104 - INFO - Subprocess[263]:            Why: A dedicated work session allows for uninterrupted      
2025-08-06 13:20:21,104 - INFO - Subprocess[264]:             focus, critical for productivity while keeping the routine     
2025-08-06 13:20:21,104 - INFO - Subprocess[265]:             simple to minimize overwhelm.                                  
2025-08-06 13:20:21,104 - INFO - Subprocess[266]:           1. Set a clear work objective and spend 45 minutes on a        
2025-08-06 13:20:21,105 - INFO - Subprocess[267]:             focused work session.                                          
2025-08-06 13:20:21,105 - INFO - Subprocess[268]:               Having a specific goal encourages consistent work        
2025-08-06 13:20:21,105 - INFO - Subprocess[269]:                 habits and aids in progressive task completion, important  
2025-08-06 13:20:21,105 - INFO - Subprocess[270]:                 for building self-trust and routine adherence.             
2025-08-06 13:20:21,105 - INFO - Subprocess[271]:           2. Take a 5-minute stretch break midway to refresh the body.   
2025-08-06 13:20:21,105 - INFO - Subprocess[272]:                Short physical breaks enhance blood flow and reduce      
2025-08-06 13:20:21,105 - INFO - Subprocess[273]:                  mental fatigue, which is especially beneficial for         
2025-08-06 13:20:21,105 - INFO - Subprocess[274]:                  managing stress and keeping energy levels balanced.        
2025-08-06 13:20:21,106 - INFO - Subprocess[275]:         Afternoon Recharge                                              
2025-08-06 13:20:21,106 - INFO - Subprocess[276]:            14:00 - 14:20                                               
2025-08-06 13:20:21,106 - INFO - Subprocess[277]:            Why: A brief recharge session re-energizes the body and     
2025-08-06 13:20:21,106 - INFO - Subprocess[278]:             mind, helping maintain momentum through the day without        
2025-08-06 13:20:21,106 - INFO - Subprocess[279]:             overburdening a novice performer.                              
2025-08-06 13:20:21,106 - INFO - Subprocess[280]:           1. Take a 10-minute light walk outdoors.                       
2025-08-06 13:20:21,107 - INFO - Subprocess[281]:               Walking provides gentle physical activity that boosts    
2025-08-06 13:20:21,107 - INFO - Subprocess[282]:                 mood and reduces work-related stress, while also           
2025-08-06 13:20:21,107 - INFO - Subprocess[283]:                 reinforcing the habit of stepping away for reset periods.  
2025-08-06 13:20:21,107 - INFO - Subprocess[284]:           2. Practice a 5-minute relaxation or mindfulness exercise.     
2025-08-06 13:20:21,107 - INFO - Subprocess[285]:                This approach addresses stress and fosters a moment of   
2025-08-06 13:20:21,107 - INFO - Subprocess[286]:                  mental clarity, essential for maintaining a balanced and   
2025-08-06 13:20:21,107 - INFO - Subprocess[287]:                  consistent routine.                                        
